@startuml
title 组件图（AI-辅助）
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
component "Vue 3 + Element Plus" as ui
component "Spring Cloud Gateway" as gateway
component "access-service" as access
component "space-service" as space
component "pass-service" as pass
component "billing-service" as billing
component "analytics-service" as analytics
component "Redis 报表缓存（可选）" as redis
interface "Space 内部 API" as spaceApi
interface "Access 只读 API" as accessApi
interface "Pass 内部 API" as passApi
interface "Billing 内部 API" as billingApi
ui --> gateway : REST JSON /api/v1
gateway --> access : 公开路由
gateway --> space : 公开路由
gateway --> pass : 公开路由
gateway --> billing : 公开路由
gateway --> analytics : 公开路由
access -- accessApi : 提供
space -- spaceApi : 提供
pass -- passApi : 提供
billing -- billingApi : 提供
access ..> spaceApi : OpenFeign 占位/充电/释放
access ..> passApi : OpenFeign 权益/预约
access ..> billingApi : OpenFeign 出账/支付
pass ..> spaceApi : OpenFeign 只读资源
analytics ..> accessApi : OpenFeign 只读车流
analytics ..> redis : 已保存报表读穿缓存
note bottom
虚线表示服务依赖提供的内部接口；网关只转发公开接口。
每个服务的独立 schema 见图3-3与图3-5～图3-9；禁止跨库 JOIN。
Redis 仅缓存 analytics 的已保存报表，MySQL 仍为权威存储。
end note
@enduml
